[
  {
    "id": 1001001050010,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……大きなお仕事なのに……\r\n灯織ちゃんもめぐるちゃんも今日はいないなんて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00007",
    "bgm": "017",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050010",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だいぶ緊張してるみたいだな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "本当にこんな大きな歌番組に\r\n新人の私が参加しても大丈夫なんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃たちイルミネーションスターズの活動が\r\n評価されて今回は真乃にオファーが来たんだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他のふたりはいないけど、今日は真乃の晴れ舞台だ\r\nもっと自信を持って",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ……晴れ舞台……わ、私の、晴れ舞台\r\nほわぁ！　き、緊張してしまいますっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みなさんは他の人の応援がしたいんじゃないでしょうか？\r\nほわわ……私、どうしたらいいのか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "心配のしすぎだよ\r\nステージに上がればわかるはずだから",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは間違ったことを言いません\r\nわ、わかりました……覚悟を決め……決めて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、そろそろ出番みたいだぞ。",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いよいよ……い、いよいよです……\r\n大丈夫ですよね、プロデューサーさん？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050060"
  },
  {
    "select": "アドバイスはしないよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺を信じて",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "自分を信じるんだ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "代わりに、耳を澄ましてみてくれないか",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ？\r\nはい……わかりましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何が聞こえる？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……たくさんの小さな音が……聞こえます\r\nなんだか、小鳥さんたちが、はばたいてるみたいな……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "どんどん、どんどん大きくなって……\r\nひとつのはばたきに……これは、もしかして……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "拍手の、音……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこにあるモニターでステージが見えるよ\r\n見てごらん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0111"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0110",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あんなにたくさんのお客さんが、\r\n私の名前を呼んでくれています！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0110",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、大きな大きな真乃コールだ。",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "全然、知りませんでした……\r\n私の歌を聴きにきてくれたファンの方が、こんなに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすがにちょっと怖いか？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0111"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いいえ……私、ここにいるみなさんに応えたい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "勇気をくれたファンのみなさんに\r\n最高のステージを届けたいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、見守っていてくれますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私……今なら、どこまでも飛べる気がしますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……信じる？\r\nプロデューサーさんを、信じる……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ、そうです\r\n私はいつでもプロデューサーさんを信じてきましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "挫けそうになったら励ましてくれて、\r\n逆に頑張りすぎたら止めてくれるんですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n真乃が頑張ってくれるから、俺もフォローできたんだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今の真乃ならきっとできる\r\nそう断言できるだけのことを、真乃はやってきた",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ……プロデューサーさんがそう言うなら\r\n私は信じますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私……やれます\r\nやってみせます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、出番だ\r\n行っておいで",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
