  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、見てた\r\nよくやったね",
    "charLabel": "mano2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みなさん、声援を送ってくれました\r\n私に……私の歌に……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今までの、真乃の頑張りがあってのことだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私だけでは今この場に立てていません\r\n全部プロデューサーさんのおかげです",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ！\r\nプロデューサーさんを信じてよかった",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050270"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "信じていいだけのことを、真乃はしてきた",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわわ……私、自分のことを信じていいんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050290,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今までつまずいてばかりな気がするんです\r\n本当に信じても？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫、信じよう\r\nこれを見て、今朝届いたばかりのファンレターだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050300,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ、今日来てくれるって書いてありますっ\r\n私を、応援するために……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだね\r\n真乃のためにずいぶん遠くから来てくれるみたいだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050310,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ……きっと大変です……\r\nでも、私を応援したいから……って",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この人だけじゃないよ\r\n会場には、たくさんの真乃のファンが応援にきてくれてる",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃のこれまでの頑張りがあるから、\r\nファンもついてきてくれるんだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃は自分を信じていいんだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050320,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、自分を信じて歌います\r\n応援してくれているみなさんに応えたいですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050330,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげで大切なことに気付けました",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100105/1001001050330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001050340,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私、やります！",
